   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 508 of the laws of 2016 amending the tax law relating\nto the imposition of an occupancy tax in the village of Mamaroneck, in\nrelation to extending the expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S6701",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6701-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §2, Chap 508 of 2016",
    "lawSection": "Taxation",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S6701\n\nSPONSOR: MAYER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 508 of the laws of 2016 amending the tax law\nrelating to the imposition of an occupancy tax in the village of Mamaro-\nneck, in relation to extending the expiration thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE OF BILL:\n\nTo extend the authority of the Village of Mamaroneck to impose a room\noccupancy tax not to exceed 3%.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 extends the current Village of Mamaroneck occupancy tax for\nanother two years until December 31, 2027.\n\nSection 2 sets the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill extends the current Village of Mamaroneck occupancy tax. The\nVillage of Mamaroneck has used these non-property tax revenues to\ncontrol property tax increases and support Village expenses not fully\ndiscretionary.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2022: S8045/A9110; L 2022, ch.  410\n\n2019: S5081/A6542; L 2019, ch.  697\n\n2016: S7154/A9693; L 2016, ch.  508\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the state.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
